# Terraform / OpenTofu
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfstate.backup
crash.log
crash.*.log
tfplan
plan.json
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraformrc
terraform.rc

# Variable files: ignored by default so a stray secret never lands in git.
# Each root's terraform.tfvars is the exception: it holds only non-secret
# settings by design (secrets live in Secrets Manager) and CI needs it.
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
!*.tfvars.example
!bootstrap/terraform.tfvars
!network/terraform.tfvars
!platform/terraform.tfvars
!live/*/*/terraform.tfvars

# Keep the dependency lock files: CI runs `init -lockfile=readonly`.
!.terraform.lock.hcl

# Tooling
.infracost/
.tflint.d/
.trivy/
.DS_Store
